  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.6.0:\n      - Adds opt-in flattening, unflattening, explicit reverse mapping, include-members, custom source expressions, custom destination paths, and value resolvers for convention mapping.\n      - Keeps advanced mapping decisions visible in deterministic mapping plans with resolver diagnostics.\n      - Preserves explicit mapping defaults: convention mapping, flattening, unflattening, and reverse mapping remain opt-in.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
